  "content": "<p>Office of the Spokesman</p>\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-default-hero-container wp-block-default-hero-container--no-featured-content \">\n\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-default-hero module featured-content page-header \">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"row bc_row\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-content__copy\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"featured-content__headline stars-above\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSecretary Rubio’s Meeting with Iraqi Prime Minister Al-Zaidi\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-meta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- get document type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta doctype-meta\">Readout</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__audience\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__location\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__publish-date\">September 21, 2026</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"page-header__actions\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Secretary of State Marco Rubio met with Iraqi Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi today to discuss the future of the U.S.-Iraq partnership. The Secretary and Prime Minister agreed on the importance of Iraq dismantling terrorist militias, preventing attacks from Iraqi territory, and fully exercising its sovereignty.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>",
